      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRUSEY (11) found one better two runs back then made mistakes last time when she broke and finished 35 metres back in fifth over 1660m at this track. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Needs to get it right to beat this field but she is up to the job. COBBITY CADENCE (1) produced a good effort at her latest run to get home by a narrow margin over 1780m at Redcliffe on August 19. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Facing a tougher assignment but she is capable of running another big race. HARPER DELIGHT (10) cannot be ruled despite the tricky draw. Best efforts give her a definite winning chance. STRADDIE BABE (8) has been about the mark of late and must be respected, the latest offering a sound third at this circuit over 1660m. One for the exotics players.",
